00:54:52,640 --> 00:54:53,640
might be less favorable than that,

914
00:54:53,640 --> 00:54:55,640
might be putting more pressure.

915
00:54:55,640 --> 00:54:56,640
So that might be another reason

916
00:54:56,640 --> 00:54:59,640
